    "message": "ci: golangci-lint v2.10.0 — drop action wrapper, install via curl + sequential 3-pass\n\nPrevious step 5 (action + args: --version) failed because the action's\ndefault `golangci-lint run <args>` rejects --version as a lint arg, marking\nthe install-binary-only step as failed and skipping the sequential run.\nReplace with a plain run: step that downloads the v2.10.0 tarball and\ninstalls the binary to /usr/local/bin, then a separate run: step loops\ngolangci-lint 3 times (dryrun / shadow / live), one build tag per call.",
